cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Neuralk OSS
abstract: >-
  Neuralk-AI open-source models: loading and inference. Seldon is a tabular
  in-context-learning foundation model: fit keeps the training table as
  context, and new rows are classified, or their target estimated, in one
  forward pass, with no gradient step. Seldon's regressor also runs time-series
  forecasting through the TabPFN-TS pipeline. The model weights, on Hugging
  Face, come under their own licenses, given in each model's repository.
authors:
  - name: Neuralk-AI
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/Neuralk-AI/neuralk_oss
keywords:
  - tabular foundation model
  - in-context learning
  - classification
  - regression
  - time-series forecasting
